fluents:
on(D,L) requires disk(D), location(L).
clear(L) requires location(L).
bar_on(D,L) requires disk(D), location(L).
bar_clear(L) requires location(L).
sep_occ.
goal_cond.
start_cond.

actions:
move(D,L,L1) requires disk(D), location(L), location(L1).
sep.

always:
executable move(D,L,L1) if on(D,L), clear(L1), clear(D).
nonexecutable move(D,L,L).
nonexecutable move(d2,L,d1).
caused on(D,L1) after move(D,L,L1), not sep.
caused -on(D,L) after move(D,L,L1), not sep.
inertial on(D,L).
caused clear(L) after move(D,L,L1), not sep.
caused -clear(L1) after move(D,L,L1), not sep.
inertial clear(L).
forbidden on(D,L), on(D,L1), L<>L1.
forbidden on(D,D).
forbidden on(d2,d1).
noConcurrency.
nonexecutable move(D,L,L1) if sep.
executable sep if on(d1,d2) , on(d2,peg1) , clear(d1) , clear(peg2) , clear(peg3), -sep_occ.
caused bar_on(D,L) after bar_on(D,L).
caused -bar_on(D,L) after -bar_on(D,L).
caused on(D,L) after on(D,L), sep.
caused -on(D,L) after -on(D,L), sep.
caused -goal_cond if on(D,L), -bar_on(D,L).
caused -goal_cond if -on(D,L), bar_on(D,L).
caused bar_clear(L) after bar_clear(L).
caused -bar_clear(L) after -bar_clear(L).
caused clear(L) after clear(L), sep.
caused -clear(L) after -clear(L), sep.
caused -goal_cond if clear(L), -bar_clear(L).
caused -goal_cond if -clear(L), bar_clear(L).
caused sep_occ after sep.
caused sep_occ after sep_occ.
caused -sep_occ after -sep_occ, not sep.
caused -goal_cond if -sep_occ.
caused goal_cond if not -goal_cond.

initially:
-sep_occ.
caused bar_on(D,L) if on(D,L).
caused -bar_on(D,L) if -on(D,L).
total on(D,L).
caused bar_clear(L) if clear(L).
caused -bar_clear(L) if -clear(L).
total clear(L).
caused start_cond if on(d1,d2) , on(d2,peg3) , clear(d1) , clear(peg1) , clear(peg2).
caused false if not start_cond.

goal:
goal_cond?
